    "title": "2-Dars: Kasrlarni ko'paytirish va bo'lish",
    "description": "Oddiy kasrlar va aralash sonlarni ko'paytirish, qisqartirish, teskari kasr va bo'lish amallari",
    "durationMinutes": 30,
    "createdAt": "2026-11-05T10:00:00.000Z",
    "questions": [
      {
        "id": "k2-1",
        "text": "Hisoblang: 2/3 * 9/10",
        "options": ["3/5", "18/30", "1/5", "4/5"],
        "correctOptionIndex": 0,
        "explanation": "Yechilishi:\nKasrlarni ko'paytirishda surat suratga, maxraj maxrajga ko'paytiriladi va qisqartiriladi:\n(2 * 9) / (3 * 10) = (1 * 3) / (1 * 5) = 3/5"
      },
      {
        "id": "k2-2",
        "text": "Hisoblang: 4/7 * 21/16",
        "options": ["3/4", "4/3", "7/16", "1/2"],
        "correctOptionIndex": 0,
        "explanation": "Yechilishi:\n4 va 16 sonlari 4 ga qisqaradi (1 va 4 qoladi), 21 va 7 sonlari 7 ga qisqaradi (3 va 1 qoladi):\n(1 * 3) / (1 * 4) = 3/4"
      },
      {
        "id": "k2-3",
        "text": "Hisoblang: 12 * 3/4",
        "options": ["9", "16", "8", "12"],
