        "explanation": "Yechilishi:\n12 ni 4 ga bo'lamiz: 3. Keyin 3 * 3 = 9"
      },
      {
        "id": "k2-4",
        "text": "Hisoblang: 5/8 * 16",
        "options": ["10", "12", "8", "5"],
        "correctOptionIndex": 0,
        "explanation": "Yechilishi:\n16 va 8 sonlari 8 ga qisqaradi: 2 qoladi. 5 * 2 = 10"
      },
      {
        "id": "k2-5",
        "text": "Hisoblang: 1 1/2 * 2 2/3",
        "options": ["4", "3 1/3", "5", "2 1/3"],
        "correctOptionIndex": 0,
        "explanation": "Yechilishi:\nAralash sonlarni noto'g'ri kasrga aylantiramiz:\n1 1/2 = 3/2, 2 2/3 = 8/3\n(3/2) * (8/3) = (3 * 8) / (2 * 3) = 8 / 2 = 4"
      },
      {
        "id": "k2-6",
        "text": "Hisoblang: 3/4 : 9/8",
        "options": ["2/3", "3/2", "27/32", "1/2"],
        "correctOptionIndex": 0,
        "explanation": "Yechilishi:\nBo'lish amali ikkinchi kasrning teskarisiga ko'paytirish bilan almashtiriladi:\n3/4 * 8/9 = (3 * 8) / (4 * 9) = (1 * 2) / (1 * 3) = 2/3"
      },
      {
        "id": "k2-7",
        "text": "Hisoblang: 6 : 2/3",
        "options": ["9", "4", "1", "12"],
        "correctOptionIndex": 0,
        "explanation": "Yechilishi:\n6 * (3/2) = (6 * 3) / 2 = 18 / 2 = 9"
      },
      {
        "id": "k2-8",
        "text": "Hisoblang: 4/5 : 2",
        "options": ["2/5", "8/5", "4/10", "1/5"],
        "correctOptionIndex": 0,
        "explanation": "Yechilishi:\n4/5 * 1/2 = (4 * 1) / (5 * 2) = 2/5"
      },
      {
        "id": "k2-9",
        "text": "Hisoblang: 3 1/3 : 1 1/9",
        "options": ["3", "10/9", "9/10", "2 1/3"],
        "correctOptionIndex": 0,
        "explanation": "Yechilishi:\n3 1/3 = 10/3, 1 1/9 = 10/9\n10/3 : 10/9 = 10/3 * 9/10 = 9 / 3 = 3"
      },
      {
        "id": "k2-10",
        "text": "5/7 kasriga teskari sonni toping:",
        "options": ["7/5 (yoki 1 2/5)", "-5/7", "-7/5", "1/7"],
        "correctOptionIndex": 0,
        "explanation": "Yechilishi:\na/b kasrga teskari kasr b/a dir. Shuning uchun 5/7 ning teskarisi 7/5 (yoki 1 2/5)."
      },
      {
        "id": "k2-11",
        "text": "Hisoblang: (1/2 + 1/3) * 6/5",
        "options": ["1", "5/6", "6/5", "2/3"],
        "correctOptionIndex": 0,
        "explanation": "Yechilishi:\n1/2 + 1/3 = 3/6 + 2/6 = 5/6\n5/6 * 6/5 = 1"
      },
      {
        "id": "k2-12",
        "text": "Hisoblang: (3/4 - 1/2) : 1/8",
        "options": ["2", "1/2", "1/4", "4"],
        "correctOptionIndex": 0,
        "explanation": "Yechilishi:\n3/4 - 2/4 = 1/4\n1/4 : 1/8 = 1/4 * 8/1 = 2"
      },
      {
        "id": "k2-13",
        "text": "Sonning 3/4 qismi 24 ga teng bo'lsa, sonning o'zini toping.",
        "options": ["32", "18", "28", "30"],
        "correctOptionIndex": 0,
        "explanation": "Yechilishi:\nQismiga ko'ra sonni topish uchun berilgan son qism ko'rsatkichiga bo'linadi:\n24 : (3/4) = 24 * (4/3) = 8 * 4 = 32"
