  {
    "id": "lesson-3",
    "number": 3,
    "title": "3-Dars: Qisqa ko'paytirish formulalari: (a+b)² va (a-b)²",
    "description": "Yig'indining kvadrati va ayirmaning kvadrati formulalari, to'la kvadratga ajratish va algebraik hisoblashlar",
    "durationMinutes": 30,
    "createdAt": "2026-11-05T10:00:00.000Z",
    "questions": [
      {
        "id": "q3-1",
        "text": "Yig'indining kvadrati formulasini ko'rsating: (a + b)^2 = ?",
        "options": ["a^2 + 2ab + b^2", "a^2 + b^2", "a^2 + ab + b^2", "a^2 - 2ab + b^2"],
        "correctOptionIndex": 0,
        "explanation": "Yechilishi:\nAsosiy qoida: Ikki son yig'indisining kvadrati birinchi sonning kvadrati, ikkilangan ko'paytmasi va ikkinchi sonning kvadrati yig'indisiga teng:\n(a + b)^2 = a^2 + 2ab + b^2"
      },
      {
        "id": "q3-2",
        "text": "Ayirmaning kvadrati formulasini ko'rsating: (a - b)^2 = ?",
        "options": ["a^2 - 2ab + b^2", "a^2 - b^2", "a^2 - ab + b^2", "a^2 + 2ab + b^2"],
        "correctOptionIndex": 0,
        "explanation": "Yechilishi:\n(a - b)^2 = a^2 - 2ab + b^2"
      },
      {
        "id": "q3-3",
        "text": "Qavslarni oching: (x + 3)^2",
        "options": ["x^2 + 6x + 9", "x^2 + 9", "x^2 + 3x + 9", "x^2 + 6x + 6"],
        "correctOptionIndex": 0,
        "explanation": "Yechilishi:\n(x + 3)^2 = x^2 + 2 * x * 3 + 3^2 = x^2 + 6x + 9"
      },
      {
        "id": "q3-4",
        "text": "Qavslarni oching: (x - 5)^2",
        "options": ["x^2 - 10x + 25", "x^2 - 25", "x^2 - 5x + 25", "x^2 + 10x + 25"],
        "correctOptionIndex": 0,
        "explanation": "Yechilishi:\n(x - 5)^2 = x^2 - 2 * x * 5 + 5^2 = x^2 - 10x + 25"
      },
      {
        "id": "q3-5",
        "text": "Qavslarni oching: (2x + 1)^2",
        "options": ["4x^2 + 4x + 1", "4x^2 + 1", "2x^2 + 4x + 1", "4x^2 + 2x + 1"],
        "correctOptionIndex": 0,
        "explanation": "Yechilishi:\n(2x + 1)^2 = (2x)^2 + 2 * (2x) * 1 + 1^2 = 4x^2 + 4x + 1"
      },
      {
        "id": "q3-6",
        "text": "Qavslarni oching: (3a - 2b)^2",
        "options": ["9a^2 - 12ab + 4b^2", "9a^2 - 4b^2", "9a^2 - 6ab + 4b^2", "6a^2 - 12ab + 4b^2"],
        "correctOptionIndex": 0,
        "explanation": "Yechilishi:\n(3a)^2 - 2 * (3a) * (2b) + (2b)^2 = 9a^2 - 12ab + 4b^2"
      },
      {
        "id": "q3-7",
        "text": "Formula yordamida tez hisoblang: 101^2 = (100 + 1)^2",
        "options": ["10201", "10101", "10200", "10001"],
        "correctOptionIndex": 0,
        "explanation": "Yechilishi:\n(100 + 1)^2 = 100^2 + 2 * 100 * 1 + 1^2 = 10000 + 200 + 1 = 10201"
      },
      {
        "id": "q3-8",
        "text": "Formula yordamida tez hisoblang: 99^2 = (100 - 1)^2",
        "options": ["9801", "9901", "9810", "9701"],
        "correctOptionIndex": 0,
        "explanation": "Yechilishi:\n(100 - 1)^2 = 100^2 - 2 * 100 * 1 + 1^2 = 10000 - 200 + 1 = 9801"
      },
      {
        "id": "q3-9",
        "text": "Ifodani to'la kvadrat ko'rinishida yozing: x^2 + 8x + 16",
        "options": ["(x + 4)^2", "(x + 8)^2", "(x + 2)^2", "(x - 4)^2"],
        "correctOptionIndex": 0,
        "explanation": "Yechilishi:\nx^2 + 2 * x * 4 + 4^2 = (x + 4)^2"
      },
      {
        "id": "q3-10",
        "text": "Ifodani to'la kvadrat ko'rinishida yozing: y^2 - 14y + 49",
        "options": ["(y - 7)^2", "(y + 7)^2", "(y - 14)^2", "(y - 49)^2"],
        "correctOptionIndex": 0,
        "explanation": "Yechilishi:\ny^2 - 2 * y * 7 + 7^2 = (y - 7)^2"
      },
      {
        "id": "q3-11",
        "text": "Agar a + b = 7 va ab = 10 bo'lsa, a^2 + b^2 ning qiymatini toping.",
        "options": ["29", "49", "39", "19"],
        "correctOptionIndex": 0,
        "explanation": "Yechilishi:\n(a + b)^2 = a^2 + 2ab + b^2 munosabatdan:\na^2 + b^2 = (a + b)^2 - 2ab = 7^2 - 2 * 10 = 49 - 20 = 29"
      },
      {
        "id": "q3-12",
        "text": "Agar a - b = 6 va ab = 5 bo'lsa, a^2 + b^2 ning qiymatini toping.",
        "options": ["46", "36", "26", "56"],
        "correctOptionIndex": 0,
        "explanation": "Yechilishi:\na^2 + b^2 = (a - b)^2 + 2ab = 6^2 + 2 * 5 = 36 + 10 = 46"
      },
      {
        "id": "q3-13",
        "text": "Agar x + 1/x = 4 bo'lsa, x^2 + 1/x^2 ning qiymatini hisoblang.",
        "options": ["14", "16", "18", "12"],
        "correctOptionIndex": 0,
        "explanation": "Yechilishi:\nIkkala tomonni kvadratga ko'taramiz:\n(x + 1/x)^2 = x^2 + 2 * x * (1/x) + 1/x^2 = 4^2\nx^2 + 2 + 1/x^2 = 16 => x^2 + 1/x^2 = 16 - 2 = 14"
      },
      {
        "id": "q3-14",
        "text": "Ifodani soddalashtiring: (x + 2)^2 - (x - 2)^2",
        "options": ["8x", "4x", "2x^2 + 8", "0"],
        "correctOptionIndex": 0,
        "explanation": "Yechilishi:\n(x^2 + 4x + 4) - (x^2 - 4x + 4) = x^2 + 4x + 4 - x^2 + 4x - 4 = 8x"
      },
      {
        "id": "q3-15",
        "text": "Hisoblang: 52^2 - 2*52*2 + 2^2",
        "options": ["2500", "2704", "2600", "2400"],
        "correctOptionIndex": 0,
        "explanation": "Yechilishi:\nBu ifoda (a - b)^2 formulasidir, bu yerda a = 52, b = 2:\n(52 - 2)^2 = 50^2 = 2500"
      }
    ]
  },
